@startuml
title RF33 — Scores Points por metas em qualquer modo · Máquina de estados: Goal.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : semeada na criação da carreira ou na pré-temporada
state "IN_PROGRESS" as IN_PROGRESS
IN_PROGRESS : 0 < progress < target
state "COMPLETED" as COMPLETED
COMPLETED : progress ≥ target
COMPLETED : aguarda crédito
state "REWARDED" as REWARDED
REWARDED : PointsTransaction GOAL_COMPLETED
REWARDED : idempotente por refId
state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED
EXPIRED : temporada ou prazo encerrado
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> IN_PROGRESS : evento elegível
IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : progresso parcial
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : progress ≥ target
ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : meta de evento único
COMPLETED --> REWARDED : crédito (teto diário, ×dificuldade)
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : prazo
IN_PROGRESS --> EXPIRED : prazo
REWARDED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
@enduml
